        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "&nbsp;Happy Canada Day!&nbsp;  Join us for the celebration of flags at 11:00am at Maffeo Sutton Park!  Catch the&nbsp;  Vancouver Island Bhangra  &nbsp;Girls Team performance at 12:30pm, followed by a community dance lesson with Sukhi Sangha!  Don't miss this exciting cultural Canada"
